msgstr "CMake"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "3.25"
msgstr "3.25"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Modern target and install rules"
msgstr "现代 target 与安装规则"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Compiler"
msgstr "编译器"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "MSVC 19.4, Clang 17, GCC 13"
msgstr "MSVC 19.4、Clang 17、GCC 13"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "C++23 is a hard requirement"
msgstr "C++23 是硬性要求"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Git submodules"
msgstr "Git 子模块"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "pinned revisions"
msgstr "固定修订"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "DataFrame, ImGui and ImPlot sources"
msgstr "DataFrame、ImGui 与 ImPlot 源码"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "none"
msgstr "不需要"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Only tooling, benchmarks and documentation use it"
msgstr "只有工具、基准与文档使用它"

#: ../../site/installation.md:12
msgid ""
"The core library needs no Python, Doxygen or Sphinx at build time. Those "
"tools are only needed to build this documentation site or run the benchmark "
"harness."
msgstr "核心库在构建时不需要 Python、Doxygen 或 Sphinx。这些工具只在构建本站点或运行基准测试时才需要。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:15
msgid "Build from a checkout"
msgstr "从检出的源码构建"

#: ../../site/installation.md:17
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp.git\n"
"cd fincore_cpp\n"
"git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/cloudQuant/fincore_cpp.git\n"
"cd fincore_cpp\n"
"git submodule update --init --recursive\n"
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:26
msgid ""
"The suite is 1092 cases and takes under a minute on a desktop machine. If "
"the configure step reports a missing `CMakeLists.txt`, the submodules were "
"not initialised."
msgstr "测试套件共 1092 个用例，在桌面机器上不到一分钟。如果 configure 报告缺少 `CMakeLists.txt`，说明子模块没有初始化。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:30
msgid "Build options"
msgstr "构建选项"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "`FINCORE_BUILD_TESTING`"
msgstr "`FINCORE_BUILD_TESTING`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "`ON`"
msgstr "`ON`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Builds the test targets; turn off for a consumer build"
msgstr "构建测试目标；消费者构建可关闭"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "`FINCORE_ENABLE_ASAN`"
msgstr "`FINCORE_ENABLE_ASAN`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "`OFF`"
msgstr "`OFF`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "AddressSanitizer on fincore targets"
msgstr "对 fincore 目标启用 AddressSanitizer"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "`FINCORE_ENABLE_UBSAN`"
msgstr "`FINCORE_ENABLE_UBSAN`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer on fincore targets"
msgstr "对 fincore 目标启用 UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "`FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT`"
msgstr "`FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Builds the ImPlot adapter; needs GUI dependencies"
msgstr "构建 ImPlot 适配器；需要图形依赖"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "`FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT_DEMO`"
msgstr "`FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT_DEMO`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Builds the demo; requires `FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT=ON`"
msgstr "构建示例；需要 `FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT=ON`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "`FINCORE_DATAFRAME_SOURCE_DIR`"
msgstr "`FINCORE_DATAFRAME_SOURCE_DIR`"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"

#: ../../site/installation.md
msgid "Uses a caller-provided DataFrame checkout instead of the submodule"
msgstr "使用调用方提供的 DataFrame 检出而不是子模块"

#: ../../site/installation.md:41
msgid ""
"A sanitizer build is a separate configuration; do not mix it into a release "
"tree:"
msgstr "消毒器构建是另一种配置；不要把它混进 release 树："

#: ../../site/installation.md:43
msgid ""
"cmake -S . -B build-asan -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo "
"-DFINCORE_ENABLE_ASAN=ON\n"
"cmake --build build-asan --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build-asan --output-on-failure\n"
msgstr ""
"cmake -S . -B build-asan -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=RelWithDebInfo "
"-DFINCORE_ENABLE_ASAN=ON\n"
"cmake --build build-asan --parallel\n"
"ctest --test-dir build-asan --output-on-failure\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:49
msgid "Install and consume"
msgstr "安装与使用"

#: ../../site/installation.md:51
msgid "cmake --install build --prefix /path/to/prefix\n"
msgstr "cmake --install build --prefix /path/to/prefix\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:55
msgid ""
"That writes the headers under `<prefix>/include/fincore`, the library under "
"`<prefix>/lib` (or `bin` on Windows) and the CMake package under "
"`<prefix>/lib/cmake/fincore`, with `fincoreConfig.cmake`, "
"`fincoreConfigVersion.cmake` (same-major compatibility) and the exported "
"targets."
msgstr ""
"它把头文件写到 `<prefix>/include/fincore`、库写到 `<prefix>/lib`（Windows 上是 `bin`），并把 "
"CMake 包写到 `<prefix>/lib/cmake/fincore`，其中包含 "
"`fincoreConfig.cmake`、`fincoreConfigVersion.cmake`（同主版本兼容）与导出的 target。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:60
msgid ""
"find_package(fincore CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS fincore)\n"
"target_link_libraries(my_target PRIVATE fincore::fincore)\n"
msgstr ""
"find_package(fincore CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS fincore)\n"
"target_link_libraries(my_target PRIVATE fincore::fincore)\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:65
msgid ""
"The installed package calls `find_dependency(DataFrame CONFIG REQUIRED)`, so"
" the consumer environment must also be able to find the DataFrame package "
"that the library was built against. Point `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` at both "
"prefixes if they are not installed side by side."
msgstr ""
"安装后的包会调用 `find_dependency(DataFrame CONFIG REQUIRED)`，因此消费者环境也必须能找到构建该库时使用的 "
"DataFrame 包。如果两者没有并排安装，请把两个前缀都加入 `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH`。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:70
msgid ""
"The optional ImPlot component is exported separately and only exists when "
"the library was built with `FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT=ON`:"
msgstr "可选的 ImPlot 组件单独导出，只有用 `FINCORE_BUILD_IMPLOT=ON` 构建时才存在："

#: ../../site/installation.md:73
msgid "find_package(fincore CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS fincore implot)\n"
msgstr "find_package(fincore CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS fincore implot)\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:77
msgid "Verify the install"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../../site/installation.md:79
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"#include <fincore/metrics/basic.hpp>\n"
"#include <cstdio>\n"
"\n"
"int main() {\n"
"    std::printf(\"%.0f\\n\",\n"
"                fincore::annualization_factor(fincore::frequency::daily));\n"
"    return 0;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"#include <fincore/metrics/basic.hpp>\n"
"#include <cstdio>\n"
"\n"
"int main() {\n"
"    std::printf(\"%.0f\\n\",\n"
"                fincore::annualization_factor(fincore::frequency::daily));\n"
"    return 0;\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:90
msgid ""
"Compile and run it against the installed prefix. If it links, the headers, "
"the library and the exported target line up; if it fails at configure time, "
"the `fincore_DIR` or the DataFrame dependency is the thing to inspect."
msgstr ""
"针对安装前缀编译并运行它。如果能链接，说明头文件、库与导出 target 对齐；如果 configure 失败，要检查的是 `fincore_DIR` "
"或 DataFrame 依赖。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:94
msgid "Platform notes"
msgstr "平台说明"

#: ../../site/installation.md:96
msgid ""
"**Windows.** Run CMake from a Visual Studio developer shell so `cl.exe` is "
"on `PATH`. Multi-config generators place binaries under `Release/`; pass "
"`--config Release` to `cmake --build` and `ctest -C Release`."
msgstr ""
"**Windows。** 从 Visual Studio 开发者命令行运行 CMake，使 `cl.exe` 在 `PATH` "
"上。多配置生成器会把二进制放在 `Release/` 下；给 `cmake --build` 传 `--config Release`，给 "
"`ctest` 传 `-C Release`。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:99
msgid ""
"**macOS and Linux.** The pinned submodules build with the system compiler; "
"no extra packages are required for the core library."
msgstr "**macOS 与 Linux。** 固定子模块用系统编译器构建；核心库不需要额外软件包。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:101
msgid ""
"**CI.** Windows and macOS are exercised on every push; the GCC 13 `ubuntu-"
"latest` job has a known constexpr-limit failure recorded in the iteration "
"notes."
msgstr ""
"**CI。** 每次推送都会覆盖 Windows 与 macOS；GCC 13 的 `ubuntu-latest` 任务存在已知的 constexpr "
"限制失败，记录在迭代说明中。"

#: ../../site/installation.md:105
msgid "Documentation build"
msgstr "文档构建"

#: ../../site/installation.md:107
msgid "The site is one Sphinx project built twice, once per language:"
msgstr "站点是一个 Sphinx 项目，按语言构建两次："

#: ../../site/installation.md:109
msgid ""
"python -m venv .venv-docs\n"
".venv-docs/bin/pip install -r docs/requirements-docs.txt\n"
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"python tools/normalize_doxygen_xml.py ../_build/doxygen/xml\n"
"sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../_build/html/en\n"
"FINCORE_DOCS_LANGUAGE=zh_CN sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . "
"../_build/html/zh_CN\n"
"cd ../..\n"
"python docs/site/tools/check_built_site.py\n"
msgstr ""
"python -m venv .venv-docs\n"
".venv-docs/bin/pip install -r docs/requirements-docs.txt\n"
"cd docs/site\n"
"doxygen Doxyfile\n"
"python tools/normalize_doxygen_xml.py ../_build/doxygen/xml\n"
"sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . ../_build/html/en\n"
"FINCORE_DOCS_LANGUAGE=zh_CN sphinx-build -b html -W -n --keep-going . "
"../_build/html/zh_CN\n"
"cd ../..\n"
"python docs/site/tools/check_built_site.py\n"

#: ../../site/installation.md:121
msgid ""
"The checker exits non-zero on a broken internal link, a machine path in the "
"built pages, or an untranslated/fuzzy catalog entry. `docs/site/README.md` "
"records the maintenance rules, including why a heading must not start with a"
" number."
msgstr ""
"检查器在内部链接断开、构建页面出现机器路径、或目录条目未翻译/为 fuzzy 时以非零退出。`docs/site/README.md` "
"记录了维护规则，包括为什么标题不能以数字开头。"

